  - hardware reuse
  - tail latency
abstract: >-
  Test script, containerized test application (Nginx, PHP-FPM, MariaDB), and raw
  measurements comparing three repurposed devices (Ryzen and Intel mini PCs and an
  ARM set-top box) as educational web servers: wrk load tests at 10-100 concurrent
  connections for static and dynamic content, sysbench, iperf3, and wall-power
  readings at idle, medium, and high load.
